    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "M.26\nHUGE GLOBE OF THE EARTH, PAN AMERICAN AIRWAYS TERMINAL, MIAMI, FLA.\nK0)16\nTANA NASSAU\n55.--\nGA-H1643\nTHE GLOBE IS 31½ FT. IN CIRCUMFERENCE AND WEIGHS 6,500 LBS.\nPHOTO BY GERECKE",
      "THOMAS\nR. WEST, MIAMI, FLA.\nThis huge globe revolves in the lobby of the\nPan-American Airways Terminal. Globe is oriented\nso that\nits axis parallels that of the carth under\nfoot at Miami\nNorth Pole points to the\nNorth\nthe course of rotation Miami\ncomes to the top of globe once every two minutes\nand the observer has opportunity to orient himself\nwith reference to rest of the world.\nPOST CARD\nTHIS SPACE FOR ADDRESS ONLY\nPLACE\nONE CENT\nSTAMP\nHERE\n22.124.522"
    ],
